{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/66291e980ff4f93cec118a3947e3d1f2.poster.avif?t=1761943880\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/66291e980ff4f93cec118a3947e3d1f2.webm?t=1761943880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/66291e980ff4f93cec118a3947e3d1f2.mp4?t=1761943880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;</strong><u>Sealed In</u><strong>&quot;</strong> is a <i>first-person psychological horror game</i> that puts you in the shoes of Rachel<strong> </strong>Morgan, a young detective returning to the house where her father committed multiple unspeakable crimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was once a quiet home is now a twisted monument of guilt, silence and buried truth. You'll need to uncover evidence, solve environmental puzzles and slowly piece together what really happened to her siblings...and what your father tried to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This house doesn't forget. And it won\u2019t let you leave until you face everything that was <i>sealed in</i> with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/b348815a42e4e5da6b73d2e862b562f4.poster.avif?t=1761943880\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/b348815a42e4e5da6b73d2e862b562f4.webm?t=1761943880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/b348815a42e4e5da6b73d2e862b562f4.mp4?t=1761943880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve immersive puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden blood or messages using the UV flashlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the evidence found somewhere in the house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair important objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the creepy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sane by taking pills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the mannequin's ecounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your father's crime scene and solve the big mystery behind the Morgan family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/590b4d554877df82c4186b5e46490db8.poster.avif?t=1761943880\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/590b4d554877df82c4186b5e46490db8.webm?t=1761943880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/extras/590b4d554877df82c4186b5e46490db8.mp4?t=1761943880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831240?t=1761943880","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/ddc33b65fd841ce1133cfea46d6af92f4b6d6b0a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761943880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/9a28278acb2d869ac6e1fc13bb5854ef49949cc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761943880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831240/9a28278